+## Key Capabilities
+
+- **PSD/PSB file parsing.** It parses PSD and PSB files, reading their structure and metadata to prepare them for inspection or modification.
+- **Layer and resource handling.** It exposes layer and resource objects through the `org.aspose.psd` namespace, enabling programmatic access to layer properties and embedded resources.
+- **Compression support.** It supports multiple compression types used in PSD and PSB files, including RLE, ZIP, and no compression, preserving the original encoding during load and save operations.
+- **Color mode support.** It handles various color modes such as RGB, CMYK, Grayscale, and Indexed, maintaining color integrity throughout the processing pipeline.
+- **Byte-exact round-trip.** It preserves all unmodified sections of the file during save, ensuring that only changed data is rewritten while the rest remains identical.
+- **Maven-based build.** It uses Maven for building and testing, with mvn package for compilation and packaging and mvn test for running the test suite.
+
